'''Furiluga''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Tales of the Nekoluga (Gacha Event)|Tales of the Nekoluga]] event. It was added in [[Version 10.9 Update|Version 10.9]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 12.6 Update|Version 12.6]] decreases time between attacks, adds a [[Surge Attack|Mini-Surge]] attack, and is immune to Surges. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 14.5 Update|Version 14.5]].

